<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
K now after posting that, I wanna appologize to Phuzzy for blowing your secret, but I will not stand idlely by and allow Shrikebot to be bad mouthed just to protect your lie.. Even though your lie is apparently the cause of an even bigger lie.. 
<br />

<br />
So in conclusion Hulk Bogan can stop his investigation, cause i believe there is no law against Redirecting from your own domain... And Im sorry for those who got offended and/or are pissed at me for Giving out this information... But I've had enuff.. 
<br />
This redirection was not the descision of any of the Shrikebot team members, but the actions of one single person , who happens to be a beta tester and obviously had major issues with his previous encounters with sturmbot... I mean if i went offline for 2 months and came back to find myself killed off, I'd be pretty mad as well... 
<br />

<br />
I have no proof that what womble said in the above is true, but it does make sense of this and it is all I or anyother Shrikebot team member has been told about this... And we all believed him.. If you choose to continue your investigation Hulk Bogan, than so be it, but please do this in a quiet and proffesional manner.. I do understand that you are mad and i do understand that you want your domain back, but bringing it into the forums here causes many lil bastards to join our forums and IRC channels and spam there hate.. we dont need this.. 
<br />

<br />
thats about all i have to say about this for now, 
<br />
Thank you 
<br />
and im sorry to all 
<br />

<br />
Joker
